# Verified Trove newspaper hits. ONE LINE PER ARTICLE WHOSE FETCHED OCR WAS
# READ AND CONTAINS THE NAME. Nothing goes in here off a search-result count:
# Trove's search is fuzzy and reports thousands of matches that contain no such
# name, so the totals live in sources/searched.json as context and the findings
# live here.
#
# tools/trove.py enumerates and fetches; a human reads; this file is written by
# hand from what was read. tools/trovedata.py turns it into site/src/data/trove.json
# and the page counts the rows rather than being told a number.
#
# date|paper|page|surname|who|what|articleid
