1939-06-10|Glenelg Private Hospital · Family Notices, Birth|12|Zubrinich|Daryl Francis Zubrinich, son of Leonard Francis and Asta|«ZUBRINICH (nee Asta Hudson) — On the 10th of June, at Glenelg Private Hospital, to Mr. and Mrs. L. F. Zubrinich — a son (Daryl Francis)» — the son of the 1936 marriage above, confirming it took|49811426
